(Bug #73: a `To` written while a clause is still open is parsed into that
 clause's body, and every pre-pass that answers "what is this function's
 signature?" scanned the top-level list flat. A swallowed definition was
 invisible to them, so a call was compiled against an empty signature - one
 argument word per parameter - and a `value` parameter's tag word was never
 pushed. The callee read its tag from a register the caller never wrote and
 reported a text as a number, then as nothing recognisable.)

For each attempt from 1 to 3,
    If attempt is 99 then, Break.
To examine with a value called given.
    Print "{given's type}".

examine of "".
Exit 0.
